{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Brings.BringConeLinkEulerNumber","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Brings.BringConeLinkEulerNumber","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":7,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.bring_over_hopf","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.bring_over_hopf","kind":"theorem","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Brings/BringConeLinkEulerNumber.lean#L61-L64","doc":"The two differ by the factor `6`: the ratio of the canonical degree of Bring's\ncurve to the degree of the Hopf bundle. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.hopf_link_euler","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.hopf_link_euler","kind":"theorem","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Brings/BringConeLinkEulerNumber.lean#L57-L59","doc":"**The quaternionic model is the cone over the Hopf bundle:** degree `1`, Euler\nnumber `−1`. Not the Bring cone's link. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.bring_link_euler","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.bring_link_euler","kind":"theorem","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Brings/BringConeLinkEulerNumber.lean#L53-L55","doc":"**Bring's curve, `g = 4`:** the link of its cone has Euler number `−6`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.canonical_link_euler_eq_chi","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.canonical_link_euler_eq_chi","kind":"theorem","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Brings/BringConeLinkEulerNumber.lean#L48-L51","doc":"**For a canonically embedded curve the link's Euler number is `χ_eu`.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.chiEu","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.chiEu","kind":"def","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Brings/BringConeLinkEulerNumber.lean#L45-L46","doc":"Topological Euler characteristic of a curve of genus `g`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.linkEulerNumber","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.linkEulerNumber","kind":"def","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Brings/BringConeLinkEulerNumber.lean#L41-L43","doc":"Seifert Euler number of the link of the cone over a curve embedded by a line\nbundle of degree `d`: `−d` (Orlik–Wagreich). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.canonicalDegree","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.canonicalDegree","kind":"def","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Brings/BringConeLinkEulerNumber.lean#L38-L39","doc":"Degree of the canonical bundle of a curve of genus `g`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}